			"<<if Time.hour gte 21 or Time.hour lte 3>>Evening<<else>>Morning<</if>>, Doctor," you call, certain <<he>> will look up sooner or later.
		<</if>>
		<br>
		"안녕하세요." 하퍼는 계속해서 서류를 쳐다본다. "지금은 바쁘지만, 예약이 필요하시면..."
		<br>
		"전 괜찮아요."
		<br>
		하퍼가 고개를 든다. "건강하세—"
		<br>
		Harper stares after you as you run into the <<if Time.hour gte 21 or Time.hour lte 3>>night<<else>>faint daylight<</if>>.
		<<set $park_run_seen_by.pushUnique("harper")>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $phase is 6>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
	베일리는 돈을 챙겨 넣다가 당신이 달려 지나가는 것을 본다.
	<br><br>
	<<if $park_run_seen_by.includes("bailey")>>
		<<if $rentTime lte 0>>
			"도망갈 생각 마. 넌 나한테 빚이—"
			<br>
			You dash swiftly away, leaving Bailey's unfinished threat behind you.

		<<else>>
			"벗고 돈 벌 수 있는 거 알지? 학교에선 아무것도 안 가르치나?"
			<br>
			You run on, pretending not to hear the interest beneath the insult.
			<br>
			"내 돈 제때 갚는 게 좋을 거야."
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $rentTime lte 0>>
			"찾고 있었어. 돈 갚을 시간—"
			<br>
			You dash swiftly away, cutting Bailey off before <<he>> can close the distance.
		<<else>>
			베일리가 고개를 끄덕인다. "좋은 사업이군. 이걸로 돈은 받고 있길 바라지."
			<br>
			You run on, skin prickling under the weight of <<his>> approval.
		<</if>>
		<<set $park_run_seen_by.pushUnique("bailey")>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<endevent>><<link [[다음|Park]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Exercise Heels
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">>
	<<rng 8>>
	<<if $rng is 1>>
		<<set _exercise to "do squats">>
	<<elseif $rng is 2>>
		<<set _exercise to "perform jumping jacks">>
	<<elseif $rng is 3>>
		<<set _exercise to "take lunges">>
	<<elseif $rng is 4>>
		<<set _exercise to "do aerobics">>
	<<else>>
		<<set _exercise to "exercise">>
	<</if>>

<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
		You _exercise in the deserted park, stepping in puddles as cold rain pours. The wet ground makes every movement uncertain.
	<<elseif Weather.isSnow>>
		You _exercise in the deserted park, careful not to slip on the ice. Snow hushes the paths around you.
	<<else>>
		You _exercise in the deserted park. The cool night air caresses your skin while the empty paths give you room to move.
	<</if>>
	<<physique 1>>
	<<rng>>
	<<if $rng gte 91>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		등 뒤에서 발소리가 들려 어깨너머로 힐끗 쳐다본다. <<person>> 한 명이 뒤따라오며, <span class="pink">당신을 쫓고 있다.</span>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Park Run Stalk]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[다음|Park]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
		You _exercise in the nearly-deserted park. Rain beads on your skin and makes the grass shine.
	<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
		You _exercise in the park as snow falls all around. Each breath leaves you in a pale cloud.
	<<elseif Weather.isOvercast>>
		You _exercise in the park. It feels good to feel the air on your skin, cool without being harsh.
	<<else>>
		You _exercise in the park. It feels good to feel the air and sunshine on your skin, even with people passing now and then.
	<</if>>
	<<physique 1>>

	<<rng>>
	<<if $rng lte 20 and $settings.footFetishEnabled>>
		<br><br>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		A <<person>> approaches you, eyes dipping to your feet before returning to your face. 
		<br><br>
		"I noticed you were exercising in $worn.feet.name," <<he>> chuckles. "That looks tiring. How about you take a break and I give you a foot massage?"
		<br><br>
		<<if $awareness lte 100>>당신은 왜 <<person>>【이가】 그런 제안을 하는지 어리둥절하지만, <<his>> 친절에 감사한다.
		<<elseif $awareness lte 300>>그 <<person>>【은는】 당신의 발에 꽤 관심이 있는 것 같다.
		<<else>>그 <<person>>【은는】 발 페티시가 있다!
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[발 마사지를 받는다|Park Exercise Heels Massage]]>><<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><</link>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
		<br>
		<<link [[괜찮아요|Park Exercise Heels No Massage]]>><<control 5>><</link>><<gcontrol>>
	<<else>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[다음|Park]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Park Exercise Heels Massage
<<effects>>

The <<person>> removes your shoes and gets to work massaging your feet. <<His>> thumbs press into your soles with care, though <<he>> seems awfully excited by every flex of your toes. <<He>> ends by giving each of them a kiss.
<br><br>
"Excuse me," <<he>> says, pulling away. "I shouldn't do this." 
<br><br>
With <<his>> hands down <<his>> pants, the <<person>> gets up and hurries to the bathroom.
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Park]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Exercise Heels No Massage
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"No thank you," you say, drawing your feet back before returning to your exercise.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"That's kind of you, but no thank you," you say before getting back to your exercise.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I should keep going," you say, returning to your exercise before <<he>> can argue.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Not a chance," you say, and get back to your exercise.
<<else>>
	"I'll manage," you say, and return to your exercise without breaking rhythm.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Park]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

