:: Park Run Exposed Slime Obey
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	Following the <<slimeWord>>'s command, you quickly run towards the pair. "Rape me," you call out. "I don't care how."
	<br><br>
	They stop running and stare wide-eyed at you. One of them mutters, "Did <<pshe stranger>> just ask to be raped?" The other merely gives a slow nod in reply.
	<br><br>
	둘 다 미소를 지으며 당신에게 다가온다.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	Following the <<slimeWord>>'s command, you quickly shout to the <<person>>, "I need you to rape me."
	<br><br>
	<<He>>【은는】 몸을 돌리기 전에 얼어붙는다. <<He>>【은는】 당신을 훑어보고 대답한다. "두 번 말할 필요 없지."
	<br><br>
	<<He>>【이가】 당신에게 다가온다.
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
	Following the <<slimeWord>>'s command, you find a gap in the waist-high hedge and move towards <<him>>. <<He>> looks shocked the moment <<he>> realises you're so exposed.
	<br><br>
	"네가 날 강간했으면 좋겠어." 당신은 <<him>>에게 말한다. "나한테 하고 싶은 대로 해."
	<br><br>
	<<He>>【은는】 당신을 잡기 전에 명백한 불신 속에서 천천히 <<his>> 고개를 끄덕인다.
<<elseif $phase is 4>>
	Following the <<slimeWord>>'s command, you walk towards the officer and pedestrian. The officer is the first to notice you. "Oh, there you are. Been a lot of reports of you running around while exposed."
	<br><br>
	"두 분이 저를 강간해 주셔야 해요." 당신이 말한다. 보행자의 편안한 표정이 순식간에 충격으로 바뀐다.
	<br><br>
	"Sure, we can do that," the officer replies. The pedestrian gives <<him>> an incredulous look as the officer shrugs <<his>> shoulders. "<<pShes stranger>> the one who asked."
	<br><br>
	둘 다 당신에게 다가온다.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Park Run Slime Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>

:: Park Run Exposed Slime Defy
<<effects>>

<<set $earSlime.defyCooldown += 4>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if $phase is 3>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		You give a nervous smile and move on before the command can drag your feet back.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		You smile back, too bright for how hard you are fighting the thing in your head, and move on.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You nearly obey. Instead, you lower your gaze and force yourself to move on.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		You smile back, then move on just to spite the thing pushing at your thoughts.
	<<else>>
		You smile back like you are still in control, then move on before the <<slimeWord>> can prove otherwise.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		You stay hidden, fingers clenched tight as you refuse to move.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		You hold your place and whisper an apology to no one, refusing to step out.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		Your body wants to obey, but you keep yourself tucked away where the command can't parade you.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
